{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226470","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226470","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1222647001:1":{"text":"早上好。","source_cn":"早上好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5481691EBFC39BF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222647002:0":{"text":"卢卡！你醒了！","source_cn":"卢卡！你醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CCEF3AF496E3776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222647003:1":{"text":"麻烦你们了。把我这大块头搬回锈锚港是不是挺费劲？","source_cn":"麻烦你们了。把我这大块头搬回锈锚港是不是挺费劲？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x636E018C7D4158A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222647004:1":{"text":"要谢就谢你身后的两位同伴吧。","source_cn":"要谢就谢你身后的两位同伴吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85E2F18C92ADD7AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222647005:1":{"text":"是他们两个把我带回来的？","source_cn":"是他们两个把我带回来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CFAB6A8CB6CCB65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222647006:1":{"text":"嘿嘿……二当家……是我们。","source_cn":"嘿嘿……二当家……是我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25A7623C332BA265","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222647007:1":{"text":"我说你们怎么老是捶后腰，原来是累着了。","source_cn":"我说你们怎么老是捶后腰，原来是累着了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53A06309E3CD1F15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222647008:1":{"text":"二当家！别把自己说得像是一坨肉，您可是血薇帮不可或缺的一份子！","source_cn":"二当家！别把自己说得像是一坨肉，您可是血薇帮不可或缺的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E97DC101A8DA1FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222647009:1":{"text":"你们两个……平时喜欢抢功劳，怎么这回谦虚起来了？","source_cn":"你们两个……平时喜欢抢功劳，怎么这回谦虚起来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA91A94B73C3F85A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222647010:1":{"text":"总不能说是因为搬运过程中不小心让您掉下马车，撞到了头……","source_cn":"总不能说是因为搬运过程中不小心让您掉下马车，撞到了头……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA49AE3D2B4DFFD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222647011:1":{"text":"闭嘴！你这笨蛋！","source_cn":"闭嘴！你这笨蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA93D3CE59034810B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_recor